    "articles": [
      {
        "sequence_id": 1,
        "text": "B. AN IRREGULAR ADJECTIVE - hoch\n\nI. The adjective hoch has occurred in this unit only as a predicate adjective:\n\nDie Mieten sind hier garnicht so hoch. The rents here are not high at all.\n\nII. As an attributive adjective the stem form hoh- with regular adjective endings occurs:\n\nWir haben hier sehr hohe Mieten. We have very high rents here.\nDas ist ein ganz hohes Etagenhaus. That's quite a high apartment building."
      }
